{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42174","headline":"病题二首 一 · 徐铉","name":"病题二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"性灵慵嬾百无能，唯被朝参遣夙兴。\n圣主优容恩未答，丹经疎阔病相陵。\n脾伤对客偏愁酒，眼暗看书每媿灯。\n进与时乖不知退，可怜身计谩腾腾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}